    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7032e605224f6c384ababe7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "竟然，收到了来自美国的邀请……！\n也就是说您要成为彼国的『女王』，\n所以才准备前往那里吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "23ed6c6d4ed279f97cf9c4aadd12675fcb218e4ace0af2937d0cbc1e926b8756",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
