    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e40bcc0fae0cb409790b1ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "记者会结束的同时，我关掉电视。\n刹那间，令人刺痛的寂静降临……\n仿佛反衬着方才记者会的盛况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03492167b52e64e021d586c3c65fb1d4c71540802836e18249bf32812b5fd42a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111313.json",
      "json_path": [
